# Google Sign-In
# 1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# 2. Create a project (or pick an existing one).
# 3. Click "Create Credentials" -> "OAuth client ID" -> Application type: "Web application".
# 4. Under "Authorized JavaScript origins" add:
#      http://localhost:5173
#      (and later your production domain, e.g. https://your-app.vercel.app)
# 5. Copy the generated "Client ID" (looks like xxxxx.apps.googleusercontent.com)
# 6. Paste it below, then rename this file to ".env" (or ".env.local")
# 7. Restart `npm run dev`

VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
